SOLUTION 1 Pure water with neutral pH
    temp      25
    pH        7.0 charge
    units     mol/kgw
    pe        4
    redox     pe
    -water    1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g)   -0.7   10
    Pyrite  0.0    0.1
    Goethite  0.0  0
    Gypsum    0.0  0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset   false
    -alkalinity  true
    -pH          true
    -totals      Fe S O
    -si          Goethite Gypsum
    -equilibrium_phases true
    -molalities Fe+2 Fe+3 SO4-2
    -high_precision true

END